# Velaris

Velaris is an Arch-based Linux distribution featuring KDE Plasma and the
CachyOS kernel. The project focuses on balanced performance, stability, and a
clean desktop experience.

Project: https://github.com/Caeluum/velaris
Downloads: https://github.com/Caeluum/velaris/releases
Support: https://github.com/Caeluum/velaris/issues

Velaris is currently in Beta. Back up important files before installation and
carefully review the partition layout shown by Calamares before confirming any
changes.

KDE Plasma on Wayland is the primary desktop session. Development builds may
also provide a Plasma X11 session for applications or drivers that require
additional compatibility.
